<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" engine="UnityEngine.UIElements" editor="UnityEditor.UIElements" noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../../UIElementsSchema/UIElements.xsd" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project://database/Assets/MainMenuStyle.uss?fileID=7433441132597879392&amp;guid=807a2b5bfa39f4b479fbe2a51d82c27d&amp;type=3#MainMenuStyle" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="mainMenu" class="main-menu" style="flex-grow: 1; background-color: rgb(254, 240, 193);">
        <ui:VisualElement name="titleContainer" class="title-container" style="transition-duration: 0.5s;">
            <ui:Label tabindex="-1" text="SHADOW OPERATIVE" parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="title" class="title" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
        <ui:VisualElement name="content" class="content">
            <ui:VisualElement name="leftContainer" class="left-container" style="transition-duration: 0.5s; flex-grow: 1;">
                <ui:Button text="Artificial Intelligence" name="artificialIntelligenceButton" parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" class="button" style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; border-top-width: 0; border-right-width: 0; border-bottom-width: 0; border-left-width: 0; border-left-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-right-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-top-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-bottom-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0);" />
                <ui:Button text="Data Analytics" parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="dataAnalyticsButton" enable-rich-text="false" class="button" style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; border-top-width: 0; border-right-width: 0; border-bottom-width: 0; border-left-width: 0; border-left-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-right-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-top-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-bottom-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0);" />
                <ui:Button text="Cyber Security" parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="cyberSecurityButton" class="button" style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; border-top-width: 0; border-right-width: 0; border-bottom-width: 0; border-left-width: 0; border-left-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-right-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-top-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-bottom-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0);" />
                <ui:Button text="Settings" parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="settingsButton" class="button" style="margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; border-top-width: 0; border-right-width: 0; border-bottom-width: 0; border-left-width: 0; border-left-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-right-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-top-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); border-bottom-color: rgba(149, 149, 149, 0); font-size: 100px;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
            <ui:VisualElement name="rightContainer" class="right-container" style="transition-duration: 0.5s; flex-grow: 1;">
                <ui:Label tabindex="-1" text="In this course, you’ll step into the future and explore the transformative world of artificial intelligence. Embark on a journey where you’ll trace AI’s fascinating history, discover how it’s reshaping industries, and imagine your future in an AI-driven career.&#10;&#10;As you progress through the learning plan, you’ll dive deep into the mechanics of AI—from understanding how it makes predictions using various types of data and neural networks, to mastering the ways it comprehends human language and interprets images. Through hands-on simulations, you’ll even build and test your own machine learning model using IBM Watson Studio, while also exploring AI ethics and the latest advances in generative AI.&#10;&#10;By the end of this immersive experience, you’ll earn the industry-recognized Artificial Intelligence Fundamentals credential, equipping you with the essential skills and insights to navigate the dynamic AI job market. Prepare to become a trailblazer in the field, ready to harness the power of AI to drive innovation and shape the future of technology." parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="artificialIntelligenceText" style="align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; white-space: normal; height: 100%; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; padding-top: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px; -unity-font: url(&quot;project://database/Library/unity%20default%20resources?fileID=10102&amp;guid=0000000000000000e000000000000000&amp;type=0#LegacyRuntime&quot;); color: rgb(58, 94, 91); font-size: 35px; display: none;" />
                <ui:Label tabindex="-1" text="In this course, you become a digital detective on a mission to uncover hidden insights within vast streams of facts and figures. With your passion for numbers leading the way, you&apos;ll explore the transformative world of data analytics, where every dataset tells a unique story.&#10;&#10;Throughout your journey, you&apos;ll master the fundamental concepts of data science—from understanding different types of data and big data analytics techniques to learning the steps involved in the data analytics process. You&apos;ll also gain practical skills by cleaning, refining, and visualizing data using IBM Watson Studio&apos;s data refinery tool, while exploring the roles of data analysts, data scientists, and data engineers.&#10;&#10;As you advance, you&apos;ll discover how data-driven insights are reshaping industries around the globe. By earning the industry-recognized Data Fundamentals credential, you&apos;ll be equipped with the essential skills and resources to launch a successful career in the dynamic world of data science." parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="dataAnalyticsText" style="align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; white-space: normal; height: 100%; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; padding-top: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px; -unity-font: url(&quot;project://database/Library/unity%20default%20resources?fileID=10102&amp;guid=0000000000000000e000000000000000&amp;type=0#LegacyRuntime&quot;); color: rgb(58, 94, 91); font-size: 35px; display: none;" />
                <ui:Label tabindex="-1" text="In this course, you become a covert operative tasked with a critical mission: uncover the hidden tactics and secrets of cyber adversaries. You will delve into the shadowy realm of digital warfare, exploring both offensive strategies—such as social engineering and high-profile cyberattacks—and the defensive measures organizations employ to protect vital intelligence.&#10;&#10;As you progress through each level, you will build on your skills by learning to analyze key cybersecurity principles, including the essential CIA triad and the financial impacts of cybercrime. Each module reinforces the previous one, ensuring that you gain a comprehensive understanding of both attack strategies and defense protocols.&#10;&#10;In addition, you&apos;ll explore how emerging technologies like artificial intelligence are reshaping the cybersecurity landscape, offering new opportunities and challenges. By the end of your journey, you&apos;ll be prepared to earn the industry-recognized Cybersecurity Fundamentals credential, setting you on the path toward a successful career in this dynamic field." parse-escape-sequences="true" display-tooltip-when-elided="true" name="cyberSecurityText" style="align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; white-space: normal; height: 100%; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; padding-top: 20px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px; -unity-font: url(&quot;project://database/Library/unity%20default%20resources?fileID=10102&amp;guid=0000000000000000e000000000000000&amp;type=0#LegacyRuntime&quot;); color: rgb(58, 94, 91); font-size: 35px; display: none;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
